# Replaces Semgrep's default ignore list, which skips test directories. RULES.md applies to
# production, test, and build code alike (CONTRIBUTING.md), so tests are scanned.
# Every entry is anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `build/` would also skip a source
# package named `build` (e.g. src/main/java/pm/crypto/build/). There is no buildSrc/ today;
# add `/buildSrc/build/` if one is introduced.
/build/
/modules/*/build/
/.gradle/
/.claude/
